🏠 AI-Based Smart Home Automation System

An AI-Based Smart Home Automation System is an intelligent home management solution that uses Artificial Intelligence, IoT, sensors, and automation to monitor and control household devices. The system can learn user preferences, detect environmental conditions, and automatically control appliances to improve comfort, security, and energy efficiency.

📌 Features

- 🤖 AI-powered automation based on user behavior and environmental conditions
- 💡 Automatic control of lights and electrical appliances
- 🌡️ Temperature and humidity monitoring
- 🚪 Smart door and access control
- 🔐 Security monitoring and intrusion detection
- 📷 Motion and presence detection
- ⚡ Energy consumption monitoring
- 🎙️ Voice-based device control
- 📱 Remote monitoring and control
- 🧠 Learning-based personalized automation
- 🚨 Real-time alerts for unusual or dangerous events

