⚙️ How It Works

1. Data Collection
   Sensors continuously collect information such as temperature, humidity, light intensity, motion, and door status.

2. Data Transmission
   The ESP32 or IoT gateway sends sensor data to the central server using Wi-Fi and MQTT/HTTP.

3. AI Analysis
   The AI module analyzes the collected data and identifies patterns in the user's behavior.

4. Decision Making
   Based on sensor readings and learned patterns, the system determines whether an appliance should be switched ON or OFF.

5. Device Control
   Commands are sent to smart devices through relays or IoT-enabled appliances.

6. Monitoring
   Users can monitor sensor data and manually control devices through a web or mobile interface.

