🚀 Installation

1. Clone the Repository

git clone https://github.com/your-username/smart-home-ai.git
cd smart-home-ai

2. Create a Virtual Environment

python -m venv venv

Activate it:

Windows

venv\Scripts\activate

Linux/macOS

source venv/bin/activate

3. Install Dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

4. Configure the System

Create a configuration file containing your:

WIFI_SSID
WIFI_PASSWORD
MQTT_BROKER
MQTT_PORT
DATABASE_URL

Do not commit passwords, API keys, or other secrets to the repository.

5. Upload the Firmware

Connect the ESP32 to your computer and upload the firmware from:

hardware/esp32/

6. Start the Backend

python backend/app.py

The dashboard can then be accessed through the configured local server address.

